# DECIDE NOW
{%- if G and G.state == "SELECTING_HAND" %}
1. A listed play marked WINS? -> play its indices.
2. DISCARDS > 0 and (a Draw is marked CHASE, or no listed play reaches PER_HAND, or a listed Draw shows 50%+)? -> discard the "Suggested discard" indices.
3. Otherwise -> play the "Suggested action" indices (or the highest listed play).
{%- elif G and G.state == "SHOP" %}
1. Affordable [XMULT] joker, or tier S/A [MAIN]/[MULT] joker with price <= SPENDABLE and SLOTS_FREE > 0? -> buy it. Otherwise follow PRIORITY (first unchecked GOAL).
2. Planet marked [MAIN] or a [BUY] voucher you can afford? -> buy it (then use the planet).
3. Pack or reroll allowed by the SHOP RULES (Standard pack while BLUE_SEALS = 0)? -> do it. Otherwise -> next_round.
{%- elif G and G.state == "SMODS_BOOSTER_OPENED" %}
1. Pick the best card by the PACK RULES (pass Suggested targets as `targets`), or skip if nothing qualifies.
{%- endif %}
Reply with exactly one tool call. Put your short reasoning first.
